      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 23,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "He conducted various investigations in this land, \r\nand a few days ago, \r\nhe ventured to an ancient site, \r\nthe \"Shadolean Great Temple,\" \r\nwhich has existed here since ancient times――",
        "Jp" : "彼はこの地で様々な調査を重ね\r\nそして数日前、いにしえよりこの地に存在する\r\n古代神殿――\r\n\"シェドレアン大神殿\"へと向かった"
